5 UNITS
For the purpose of design calculations the following units are recommended:
a) forces and loads, in kN, kN/m, kN/m2;
b) unit mass, in kg/m3;
c) unit weight, in kN/m3;
d) stresses and strengths, in N/mm2 (= MN/m2 or MPa); and e) moments (bending, etc), in kNm.
For conversion of one system of units to another system, [C-6A(1)] may be referred.

